{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "Recover released record" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Recover released record"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"恢复已释放记录"}}}},
    "Recovery requires released process locks and confirmed host authorization cleanup. Damaged or unconfirmed records remain blocked." : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Recovery requires released process locks and confirmed host authorization cleanup. Damaged or unconfirmed records remain blocked."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"恢复要求进程锁已释放，并且宿主授权清理已确认。损坏或未确认的记录仍会阻止启动。"}}}},
    "Process record recovered. Check the connection again when ready; no process was started." : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Process record recovered. Check the connection again when ready; no process was started."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"进程记录已恢复。准备好后可再次检查连接；本次未启动进程。"}}}},
    "Only this reviewed record will be retired. No process or downstream action will be started." : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Only this reviewed record will be retired. No process or downstream action will be started."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"仅清理这条已查看的记录，不会启动进程或执行下游操作。"}}}},
    "Previous MCP cleanup is unconfirmed. Review the process records before starting another connection." : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Previous MCP cleanup is unconfirmed. Review the process records before starting another connection."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"之前的 MCP 清理尚未确认。请先查看进程记录，再启动连接。"}}}},
    "Host session is active" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Host session is active"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"宿主会话活跃"}}}},
    "Process has stopped" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Process has stopped"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"进程已停止"}}}},
    "Waiting for process cleanup" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Waiting for process cleanup"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"等待进程清理"}}}},
    "Process cleanup needs recovery" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Process cleanup needs recovery"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"进程清理需要恢复"}}}},
    "Host authorization cleanup is unconfirmed" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Host authorization cleanup is unconfirmed"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"宿主授权清理尚未确认"}}}},
    "Process record is damaged" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Process record is damaged"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"进程记录已损坏"}}}},
    "HTTP bearer authentication" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"HTTP bearer authentication"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"HTTP Bearer 认证"}}}},
    "Credential endpoint" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Credential endpoint"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"凭据绑定地址"}}}},
    "Keychain account" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Keychain account"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"钥匙串账户"}}}},
    "HTTP only. Bind the exact server URL and save these settings, then use Manage credential to store the token. An endpoint change requires a new binding; redirects are rejected." : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"HTTP only. Bind the exact server URL and save these settings, then use Manage credential to store the token. An endpoint change requires a new binding; redirects are rejected."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"仅适用于 HTTP。绑定完整服务器地址并保存设置，再通过“管理凭据”保存令牌。地址变更需要重新绑定；不接受重定向。"}}}},
    "Manage credential" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Manage credential"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"管理凭据"}}}},
    "Credential is stored." : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Credential is stored."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"凭据已保存。"}}}},
    "Credential is missing." : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Credential is missing."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"缺少凭据。"}}}},
    "Bearer token" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bearer token"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bearer 令牌"}}}},
    "The token is stored only in the host Keychain. New requests read the current value; changing it does not cancel already issued requests." : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The token is stored only in the host Keychain. New requests read the current value; changing it does not cancel already issued requests."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"令牌仅保存在宿主钥匙串中。新请求读取当前值；更改凭据不会取消已发出的请求。"}}}},
    "Remove credential" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Remove credential"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"删除凭据"}}}},
    "MCP credentials require an exact endpoint binding using HTTPS or loopback HTTP, and a valid Keychain account." : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"MCP credentials require an exact endpoint binding using HTTPS or loopback HTTP, and a valid Keychain account."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"MCP 凭据必须绑定完整的 HTTPS 或本机回环 HTTP 地址，并使用有效的钥匙串账户。"}}}},
    "The host cannot access the MCP credential. Check the App's Keychain identity and unlock state." : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The host cannot access the MCP credential. Check the App's Keychain identity and unlock state."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"宿主无法访问 MCP 凭据。请检查应用的钥匙串身份和解锁状态。"}}}},
    "The MCP credential is missing. Save it through the host before connecting." : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The MCP credential is missing. Save it through the host before connecting."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"缺少 MCP 凭据。请先通过宿主保存，再连接。"}}}},
    "The MCP bearer token must be nonempty printable ASCII without whitespace, at most 16 KiB." : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The MCP bearer token must be nonempty printable ASCII without whitespace, at most 16 KiB."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"MCP Bearer 令牌必须为不含空白的非空可打印 ASCII，且不超过 16 KiB。"}}}},
    "Workspace" : { "localizations" : {
      "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Workspace" } },
      "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "工作区" } }
    } },
    "Check connection" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Check connection"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"检查连接"}}}},
    "Choose a workspace" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Choose a workspace"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"选择工作区"}}}},
    "Register a workspace before checking a connection." : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Register a workspace before checking a connection."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"请先注册工作区，再检查连接。"}}}},
    "Server version" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Server version"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"服务器版本"}}}},
    "Starts only this enabled MCP to check its connection and catalog. No tools are called, dependencies installed or grants changed." : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Starts only this enabled MCP to check its connection and catalog. No tools are called, dependencies installed or grants changed."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"仅启动当前已启用的 MCP，检查连接和工具目录。不调用工具、不安装依赖，也不更改授权。"}}}},
    "Not verified: tool execution, remote profile permissions, system permissions and persistent host services." : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Not verified: tool execution, remote profile permissions, system permissions and persistent host services."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"未验证：工具执行、远程配置权限、系统权限及持久化宿主服务。"}}}},
    "The registration is disabled; no connection was started." : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The registration is disabled; no connection was started."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"此注册已禁用，未启动连接。"}}}},
    "The selected MCP initialized and returned its tool catalog. Tool execution and production permissions were not checked." : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The selected MCP initialized and returned its tool catalog. Tool execution and production permissions were not checked."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"所选 MCP 已初始化并返回工具目录。尚未检查工具执行和生产权限。"}}}},
    "The selected MCP did not complete connection and catalog discovery. Check the launch configuration, endpoint authentication and system permissions." : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The selected MCP did not complete connection and catalog discovery. Check the launch configuration, endpoint authentication and system permissions."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"所选 MCP 未完成连接和目录发现。请检查启动配置、端点认证及系统权限。"}}}},
    "Outstanding calls may have an unknown outcome. Reconnect and inspect before retrying." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Outstanding calls may have an unknown outcome. Reconnect and inspect before retrying." } },
        "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "未完成调用的结果可能不明。重新连接后，请先核验结果再决定是否重试。" } }
      }
    },
